summary: Guest-components sample-attestation plan

description: |
  Run the RPM-installed guest-side attester against a protocol-compatible
  containerized KBS. The plan is for standard x86_64 hardware and does not
  request a Confidential VM.

discover:
  how: fmf
  test:
    - /Functional/guest-components-sample-attestation

execute:
  how: tmt
